  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IRF (FY26-27)/ Urgent Support to Maintain Essential Electricity Services in Refugee Camps in Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide urgent, short-term funding to maintain reliable electricity supply in Zaatari and Azraq refugee camps, ensuring continued operation of households, streetlighting, and critical services.

Sustaining electricity reduces protection risks, supports health and emergency response, and prevents harmful coping strategies among vulnerable refugee populations.</narrative>
  </description>
